d csdid_plot - Event-study plot after csdid
d Jerg Gutmann
d Version 0.1.0 (beta). Plots csdid event-study results (estat event) with the confidence intervals of csdid in the same layout as french_plot, lpdid_plot and did2s_plot; optionally the averages, joint tests and p-values. Requires Stata 16 or newer and csdid.
